  "steps": [
    "Pat the tofu dry with kitchen paper, then cut it into bite-sized cubes and season with a pinch of salt.",
    "Cook the rice noodles according to the packet instructions until just tender. Drain, rinse under cold water until cool, then drain very well.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a non-stick frying pan over medium-high heat. Fry the tofu for 8–10 minutes, turning occasionally, until golden on several sides and lightly crisp. Set aside to cool slightly.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lime juice, tamari, brown sugar, sliced chilli, grated garlic and sesame oil until the sugar dissolves.",
    "Put the noodles, cucumber, carrot, red bell pepper, bean sprouts and spring onions in a large bowl. Add most of the mint and coriander, reserving a little for garnish.",
    "Pour over the lime dressing and toss well until the noodles and vegetables are evenly coated.",
    "Divide the salad between two bowls, top with the golden tofu, toasted sesame seeds and the reserved herbs. Serve immediately, or chill for up to 2 hours and toss again before eating."
